  {
   "text": "{\"explanations\":[{\"signal_id\":\"2a8012a8-39d5-408f-b604-e21d87b909c8\",\"explanation\":\"Unrestricted cash headroom slipped from {{fact:3ce160dd-3a08-48c9-bb27-ba864fb42ea9}} to {{fact:9c317a78-fb2b-4ef1-8d0b-99c44a0f3974}}, then fell sharply to {{fact:2906f61f-4b39-46a4-964a-c9a108fc19cf}} in October. Cash of {{fact:a280aeb3-37d8-4e61-b9b6-7bd220b149f0}} still clears the {{fact:2e0970d5-4f5d-4491-bf43-4b2ff6fc2d2e}} floor. The runway decline points the same way, suggesting cash burn picked up.\"},{\"signal_id\":\"68a2de93-1c61-44f7-bf70-5f08429c7596\",\"explanation\":\"Runway headroom fell from {{fact:bc6196a2-5e4a-405b-a31a-3507c574581f}} to {{fact:ab609b05-cc7f-49e3-885d-d5d2cabfd20f}} and then to {{fact:c088cb13-c166-4468-ba16-365e40e93a7c}}, with the steepest drop in October. Runway of {{fact:ccb823a4-d9d6-4a9a-ad4e-4b352a725383}} months is still well above the {{fact:b922f3af-45bc-42e7-abf0-39ee86c2a5e1}}-month minimum. The October drop mirrors the falling cash balance, so both covenants reflect the same liquidity pressure.\"},{\"signal_id\":\"60bacd24-c868-4254-b47b-5006862a9acf\",\"explanation\":\"Revenue headroom has been essentially flat, at {{fact:018378f7-0ac5-4927-a5d6-7fed9f650a7f}}, {{fact:8ecd74bb-c12a-4cbe-b597-e72a4aa38448}} and {{fact:6bee3bb8-0aa3-4731-a413-f092a6711030}}. Revenue is running at {{fact:7afe03cb-986c-438b-a580-887f6533735b}} of plan against an {{fact:5801d833-6a61-43d7-a541-8526ce1751ac}} floor. This suggests the cash and runway declines stem from spending or working capital rather than weaker sales.\"}],\"ranking\":[\"2a8012a8-39d5-408f-b604-e21d87b909c8\",\"68a2de93-1c61-44f7-bf70-5f08429c7596\",\"60bacd24-c868-4254-b47b-5006862a9acf\"]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
